11. FAILURE MODE ANALYSIS

Mode Scenario Consequence Mitigation
FM1 Lock fails to release in crash ESEMS inactive; baseline restraints unaltered. No additional injury. Redundant actuator signals, IMU backup, mechanical witness pin.
FM2 Inadvertent release during normal driving Seat slides up to 80 mm unexpectedly; potential distraction/hazard. CPI sustain filter (10 ms), mechanical end‑stops, spring‑return re‑engagement.
