FM4 Re‑engagement during crash Blocked motion mid‑stroke. Design eliminates re‑engagement until near‑zero velocity detected post‑crash.

FM1 is the dominant and safest failure mode. All hardware is designed to maximise its probability and minimise FM2/FM3.

